 AskForNumberWithLargeQuestion;parms;question
 parms←##.GUI.Request.CreateParmsForNumber
 parms.value←10
 question←''
 question,←⊂'Make sure you understand the request!'
 question,←⊂'This is a very very very very long line that defines the widths of the form'
 question,←⊂'Number of copies:'
 question,←⊂''
 question,←⍕¨⍳10
 ⎕←parms ##.GUI.Request.AskForNumber question
⍝Done
